        "slc_c725ff51943399eb59ae7766f587872d7ba6d502a1fd21f6fb64d703ef783aa7"
      ],
      "text": "Plugins consist of paired Python and YAML files in a plugins folder (e.g. ascii_render.py and ascii_render.yaml) with required fields such as parameters and returns; sample plugins include anomaly_detection, ascii_render, klarna_search, and tell_joke."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
