        "slc_f542b07e7055cdfd2b1102e0751609758e71e9592b133d2831f55e2b2eea2a53"
      ],
      "text": "The sql_pull_data example plugin is implemented on top of Langchain and requires installing langchain and tabulate; the forecasting example requires yfinance and statsmodels."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_96cf7bbea9574367a22df3f9f87ee918392a2122c8322c91ab82c8c990096f1f",
